[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5092605248","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121825#issuecomment-5092605248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121825","id":5092605248,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL4r9QA","user":{"login":"enderprism","id":76617157,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NjE3MTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76617157?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism","html_url":"https://github.com/enderprism","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enderprism/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T14:28:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T14:28:24Z","body":"my point for making explicit this implementation detail is that game or apps that have custom implementation of the inspector (e.g. a level editor, a video editing app) and try to use reflection in order to avoid bloating code with custom methods will run into this issue if they support resetting the value of a property to default.\r\n\r\ni know it's very specific but i myself wouldn't have encountered this issue if there had been documentation warning me (i would have re-implemented it myself).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5092605248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5092869919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121825#issuecomment-5092869919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121825","id":5092869919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL48HHw","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T14:52:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T14:52:05Z","body":"Do not misinterpret it. I (we?) don't think this is \"very specific\" at all and it's worth documenting. @AThousandShips just wanted to clarify that this is an implementation detail.\r\n\r\nNormally, there's **Script**, which is the base class for any script, and then there's `GDScript` and `CSharpScript` which inherit from it. Extensions [can add more language bindings](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/other_languages.html), which warrant new Script resource types, and these scripts are not guaranteed to return `null` like the officially-supported ones do.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5092869919/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5092921047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121825#issuecomment-5092921047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121825","id":5092921047,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL4_O1w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-27T14:56:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T14:56:39Z","body":"Indeed we need to strike a balance between:\r\n* Solving any confusion arising over this not being documented (would be good to know if it's at all common)\r\n* Causing confusion by not being specific enough and causing conflicts with third party features, or discourage using it freely in extensions\r\n* Co